%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '15px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant W as DirectoryWatcher<br/>(FSEvents, Swift)
    participant SC as SyncViewModel<br/>(Swift client)
    participant H as SyncHandler<br/>(Go API)
    participant SS as SyncService
    participant REP as FileRepo
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    W->>SC: local folder change event<br/>(debounced 1.5s) / 45s poll timer
    SC->>SC: GET /api/files (list remote)
    SC->>H: POST /api/sync/diff<br/>{lastSyncedVersion}
    H->>SS: Diff(uploadedBy, sinceVersion)
    SS->>REP: ListChangedSince(uploadedBy, sinceVersion)
    REP->>DB: SELECT files, file_deletions<br/>WHERE version > sinceVersion
    DB-->>REP: changed rows, deleted rows, currentVersion
    REP-->>SS: files[], deletions[], currentVersion
    SS-->>H: actions[] (download | delete_local), newVersion
    H-->>SC: 200 OK { actions[], newVersion }

    loop for each action
        alt action == download
            SC->>SC: fetch content, write to<br/>local folder, record entry
        else action == delete_local
            SC->>SC: remove local file, drop entry
        end
    end
    SC->>SC: lastSyncedVersion := newVersion

    SC->>SC: scan local folder<br/>(name, size, sha256)
    loop for each local file vs. known entries
        alt new file, no remote match
            SC->>H: POST /api/files (upload)
        else known file, content changed
            SC->>H: DELETE /api/files/{id}<br/>POST /api/files (re-upload)
        else known entry, file missing locally
            SC->>H: DELETE /api/files/{id}
        end
    end
    SC->>SC: persist sync state to disk

    note over SC,U: If the same file changes on both sides between<br/>two reconciles, whichever half of this routine<br/>runs first wins — there is no server-side manifest<br/>comparison, so no true conflict is detected or<br/>surfaced to the user.
